{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"iTotal":432,"list":[{"sChanId":["296"],"sTitle":"「极危通缉与悠游假期」活动说明","sIntro":"「极危通缉与悠游假期」活动说明","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动时间】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2026/08/24 10:00（服务器时间） ~ 2026/09/07 03:59（服务器时间）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【参与条件】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e绳网等级≥20级，完成主线第一章·幕间后即可参与。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动期间，绳匠可前往布亚斯特与事务专员对话，为她提供「通缉犯」的线索。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动期间，活动委托将逐天解锁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 完成活动委托，可获得[菲林]、[邦布券]和各类养成材料奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/165829/170d2aa4238e2725b52761e90e3522aa_6917421004858414834.jpg\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/165829/173cafa94ce49d9e5789083da90bd802_378741269544274206.jpg\"}],\"news-self-path\":\"\"}","dtStartTime":"2026-08-21 12:15:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2026-08-19 19:01:23","iInfoId":165829,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""},{"sChanId":["296"],"sTitle":"「咔滋酥脆出餐计划」活动说明","sIntro":"「咔滋酥脆出餐计划」活动说明","sUrl":